    symbol: "🜎",
    card_description: "Mylius's Opus Medico-Chymicum (1618) is one of the key Luca Jennis alchemical publications, with 12 plates by Matthäus Merian. Its imagery closely parallels the Atalanta Fugiens illustrations produced the same year and provides important comparative material for the Frankfurt alchemical publishing network of 1617–1618.",
