    card_description: "Maier's Arcana Arcanissima (1614), published in London, is his systematic proof that all Greek and Egyptian mythology is encoded alchemical philosophy. Its illustrations show mythological scenes (Hercules, Bacchus, Ceres, Isis) with explicit alchemical identification. An early statement of the mythological-alchemical method he would perfect in the Atalanta Fugiens four years later. Already extracted in the corpus.",
